  "releaseNotes": "Discover.ConnectAsync no longer caches connected devices across separate calls (reverting the 1.2.2 persistent cache); it always returns an instance exclusively owned by the caller, aside from unchanged in-flight concurrent-connect coalescing. Added Discover.GetOrConnectSharedAsync as an explicit, opt-in API for call sites that are known to target the same device and want to share one connection; it reuses a live shared instance keyed by host/port and transparently reconnects if the shared instance was disposed. No reference counting is used. No breaking API changes.",
